---
title: Roasted Tomato Soup
servings: 3
time: 50 minutes
---

Halve @tomatoes{1%kg} and toss with @olive oil{3%tbsp}, @garlic{4%cloves} and @salt{1%tsp}.

Roast on a #baking tray{} at 200°C for ~{35%minutes}, until the edges char.

Blend with @vegetable stock{500%ml} until smooth, then reheat in a #pot{} and finish with @basil{1 handful}.
